    "show_share": true,
    "description": "At the launch of the new  Global Strategy for Women's, Children's and Adolescents' Health  during a high-level  Every Woman Every Child  event hosted by the UN Secretary-General on September 26, the Aga Khan University was among more than 100 organizations and over 40 countries, which pledged their commitment to promote women's and children's health.",
